<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-CAPTAIN TO MISS AMERICAN DATE.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-CAPTAIN TO MISS AMERICAN DATE.</headline>
<dateline>CARDIFF 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wales captain Jonathan Humphreys will definitely miss Saturday's international against the United States after being sent off in last weekend's European Cup semifinals.</p>
<p>Humphreys has decided not to appeal against a seven-day suspension imposed following the first dismissal of his career in Cardiff's 26-13 defeat at French club Brive.</p>
</text>
